//! registration — not worth waiting on somebody else to publish.
//!
//! Names are the icon's own, upper-cased with separators collapsed:
//! `chevron-down` becomes `CHEVRON_DOWN`. The editor does not use these
//! directly — see [`super::icons`] for the vocabulary that does.

